<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SCORE 267 FOR SEVEN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA SCORE 267 FOR SEVEN.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 267 for seven in 50 overs against West Indies in their World Series limited overs match at the WACA ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia 267 for seven in 50 overs (Mark Waugh 92) v West Indies.</p>
